     <widget class="QWidget" name="tab_7">
      <attribute name="title">
       <string>Problem 3</string>
      </attribute>
      <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="verticalLayout_4">
       <item>
        <widget class="QTextBrowser" name="textBrowser_7">
         <property name="html">
          <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:600; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;[6 pts]  Topic:  Using &lt;span style=&quot; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;Qt/C++ Statements&lt;/span&gt; to Configure and Create &lt;span style=&quot; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;Non-Modal Popup Dialogs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;==&amp;gt; You may use hand-written &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Qt4-style&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt; or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Qt5-style&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt; connect statements on this problem &amp;lt;==&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Add Qt/C++ Statement(s) to the files &lt;span style=&quot; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;dialog.h&lt;/span&gt; and/or &lt;span style=&quot; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;dialog.cpp&lt;/span&gt; to complete the following tasks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;(1)  Left-click of &lt;span style=&quot; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;spawnPopupButton&lt;/span&gt; must generate a &lt;span style=&quot; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;NON-MODAL&lt;/span&gt; popup dialog with the properties described below&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;(2)  &lt;span style=&quot; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Every popup dialog spawned&lt;/span&gt; must include the following items&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;        *  The popup dialog must utilize a &lt;span style=&quot; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;QVBoxLayout&lt;/span&gt; to organize all widgets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;        *  The popup dialog must contain a &lt;span style=&quot; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;QSlider&lt;/span&gt; object with object name &lt;span style=&quot; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;yourSlider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;        *  Write code to set the &lt;span style=&quot; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;MAXIMUM value&lt;/span&gt; of &lt;span style=&quot; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;yourSlider&lt;/span&gt; to &lt;span style=&quot; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;        *  Invoke &lt;span style=&quot; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;setTickPosition(QSlider::&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;TicksBothSides&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;) &lt;/span&gt; to make tick marks visible in &lt;span style=&quot; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;yourSlider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;(3)  Add connect statement(s) such that any change in the value of &lt;span style=&quot; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;mySlider&lt;/span&gt; results in a matching change to the value of &lt;span style=&quot; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;yourSlider&lt;/span&gt; in &lt;span style=&quot; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;ALL popups&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;(4)  Add connect statement(s) such that any change in the value of &lt;span style=&quot; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;yourSlider&lt;/span&gt; in any popup results in a matching change to the value of &lt;span style=&quot; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;mySlider &lt;/span&gt;and &lt;span style=&quot; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;yourSlider&lt;/span&gt; in &lt;span style=&quot; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;ALL other popups&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;(5)  &lt;span style=&quot; font-size:14pt;&quot;&gt;Add code to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:14pt; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;CLOSE ALL THE OPEN POPUP DIALOGS &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:14pt;&quot;&gt; upon left-click of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:14pt; color:#0617f3;&quot;&gt;QPushButton&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:14pt;&quot;&gt; object named &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:14pt; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;closePopupsButton&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:14pt; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;      *  closePopupsButton &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;must&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:14pt; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt; NOT &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;close the entire application&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:14pt; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;-- just&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:14pt; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt; ALL &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;of the popups currently open&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;HINTS:   The &lt;span style=&quot; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;QSlider&lt;/span&gt; widget's object name is &lt;span style=&quot; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;mySlider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;               The &lt;span style=&quot; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;QPushButton&lt;/span&gt; widget's object names are &lt;span style=&quot; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;spawnPopupButton&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;span style=&quot; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;closePopupsButton&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
